{"id":"48c1180d4b0f90db","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-subformula-property.md","title":"Subformula Property","display":"df-subformula-property — Subformula Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-subformula-property","aliases":["72-df-subformula-property"],"display":"df-subformula-property — Subformula Property","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.3–1.2.4 print12–13/PDF24–25","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-subformula-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-subformula-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subformula-property — Subformula Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.3–1.2.4 print12–13/PDF24–25"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\\ \\exists B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi))\\ (A\\in\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\\ \\exists B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi))\\ (A\\in\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是实际扩充语法的字面子公式谓词。一般一阶无切证明并不满足该谓词；量词实例的项代入不保留字面子公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$；$\\operatorname{Fml}$ 见 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]]，$\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}$ 见 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$；$\\operatorname{Fml}$ 见 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]]，$\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}$ 见 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall u\\in D\\ \\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\ell(u))\\ \\exists B\\in\\operatorname{Fml}(\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi))\\ (A\\in\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(B)).","display":true}],"bytes":1414,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-subformula-property|df-subformula-property — Subformula Property]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-subformula-property|df-subformula-property — Subformula Property]]"},{"id":"0842809a20d60f94","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma}$，各相继式标签中的每个公式都无量词；$\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}$ 取 [[72-df-subformula-property]] 的扩充语法版本。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-subformula-property|72-df-subformula-property]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4","f9452e4a7788a117","3c073b947b255638"]}